Dataset: eic_estatal
-------------------

Source institution: Instituto Nacional de Estadística y Geografía
(INEGI)
Source program: Encuesta Intercensal 2025
Source product: Principales resultados por localidad de 50 000
y más habitantes
Selected coverage: 32 state-level records and 10 source variables
Observation year: 2025
Downloaded: 2026-10-19

Source page:
https://www.inegi.org.mx/programas/eic/2025/#datos_abiertos

Reuse terms: Términos de Libre Uso de la Información del INEGI.
These terms permit copying, redistribution, adaptation, extraction,
and commercial use, subject to the stated conditions, including
source attribution, preservation of metadata when distributing
copies, disclosure of transformations, and avoidance of implied
INEGI endorsement.

Terms:
https://www.inegi.org.mx/inegi/terminos.html

Preparation: Used a supplied extract containing 32 state records
and 10 selected source variables. Preserved original field names,
state names, row order, and numeric values. Retained CVE_ENT as
character to preserve leading zeros. Converted population counts,
median age, and percentages to double. Checked structure, missing
and blank values, unique state names and codes, numeric
representation, permissible ranges, and consistency between
age-group counts and population totals. Variable descriptions
were adapted to state-level coverage using the supplied source
data descriptor.

